WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:02.810
- So a bunch of Redditors on
WallStreetBets have coordinated

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.480
to inflate the stock price
(air whooshing)

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.020
of GameStop, trying to
basically bankrupt a hedge fund

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.270
that has the opposite position.

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:10.673
Who cares? YOLO!

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.000
But is this legal?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.360
Well, generally you can't conspire

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.470
to set the price of
anything, let alone stock.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.710
And there are generally
two types of things

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:19.943
that the SEC really likes to
put a stop on. (air whooshing)

00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:20.776
One is fraud.

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:22.910
You can't lie about a stock
to try and inflate the price.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:25.030
And two is what's called
market manipulation.

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:27.037
Illegal market manipulation is defined as,

00:00:27.037 --> 00:00:29.270
"To affect a loan or one
or more other persons

00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:30.860
a series of transactions and any security,

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.650
creating actual or apparent act of trading

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.760
in such security or raising
or depressing the price

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.120
of such security for the
purpose of inducing the purchase

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.020
or sale of such security by others."

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.110
Market manipulation is a very squishy term

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:42.050
that's very hard to decide

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:43.490
because often you're buying a stock,

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:45.040
hoping that others will buy it as well

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.060
and inflate the price.
(air whooshing)

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:47.710
But just because a bunch
of Redditors are doing it

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:50.020
for the LOLs doesn't
mean it's not illegal.

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:50.853
It depends.
(air whooshing)

00:00:50.853 --> 00:00:52.220
And this one could go either way.

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:54.160
And that's why you should only
buy orange juice concentrate,

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:55.440
pork bellies, and gold bullion.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.953
And I'll see you in court.
(bell dings)

